---
description: Unread History repo rules (always apply)
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md first; it is the single source of rules for this repo. Short version: never commit API keys, scans or personal data; sources must be public domain and fetchable per robots.txt; run Python that reads downloaded data with -I; Grothendieck notes = short quotes only; no claim about a find before the four checks (human read of scan, maths by code, literature search starting from the author own works and older sources, independent unanchored review); audit counts, not "DONE" messages; run src/validate.py data/<author> --status before any PR; append to ledger/LEADS.md, never rewrite others verdicts; plain language, evidence separated from interpretation.
